==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Once {{m|en|variants||''[[tvímyndir]]''; a different spelling, pronunciation, or form of the same word}} of {{m|is|foreldri||a parent}}.<ref name="arna">[http://www.arnastofnun.is/page/arnastofnun_ord_pistlar_foreldrar ''foreldrar — foreldri'']</ref> It is rare that a word's gender differs between grammatical numbers, but modern dictionaries generally list them as two distinct words — even though their form and declension is similar.<ref name="arna"/> The reason for this disparity in usage is the masculine word's lack of singular form.<ref name="arna"/>

